        "subject": "=Еженедельная статистика GitHub Issues ({{ $('Calculate Delta').item.json.current.week_date }})",
        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; color: #24292f; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; border-radius: 8px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #0969da; margin-top: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid #eaeef2; padding-bottom: 10px;\">\n    📊 Еженедельная статистика GitHub Issues ({{ $('Calculate Delta').item.json.current.week_date }})\n  </h2>\n  \n  <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #57606a;\">\n    Автоматический дайджест состояния репозитория за прошедшие 7 дней.\n  </p>\n\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr style=\"background-color: #f6f8fa; border-bottom: 2px solid #d0d7de;\">\n        <th style=\"padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de;\">Метрика</th>\n        <th style=\"padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; text-align: center;\">За эту неделю</th>\n        <th style=\"padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; text-align: center;\">Δ к прошлой неделе</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; font-weight: 600;\">Всего новых Issues</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; text-align: center;\">{{ $('Calculate Delta').item.json.current.new_issues }}</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; text-align: center; color: #0969da; font-weight: 600;\">{{ $('Calculate Delta').item.json.delta.new_issues }}</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc;\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; font-weight: 600;\">Закрыто Issues</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; text-align: center;\">{{ $('Calculate Delta').item.json.current.closed_issues }}</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; text-align: center; color: #1a7f37; font-weight: 600;\">{{ $('Calculate Delta').item.json.delta.closed_issues }}</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de;\">Ошибки (Bugs)</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; text-align: center;\">{{ $('Calculate Delta').item.json.current.bugs }}</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; text-align: center;\">{{ $('Calculate Delta').item.json.delta.bugs }}</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc;\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de;\">Задачи (Tasks)</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; text-align: center;\">{{ $('Calculate Delta').item.json.current.tasks }}</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; text-align: center;\">{{ $('Calculate Delta').item.json.delta.tasks }}</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de;\">Новые возможности (Features)</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; text-align: center;\">{{ $('Calculate Delta').item.json.current.features }}</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; text-align: center;\">{{ $('Calculate Delta').item.json.delta.features }}</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr style=\"background-color: #fff8c5;\">\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; font-weight: 600;\">Ожидают триажа (Needs-triage)</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; text-align: center; font-weight: 600;\">{{ $('Calculate Delta').item.json.current.needs_triage }}</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de; text-align: center; font-weight: 600;\">{{ $('Calculate Delta').item.json.delta.needs_triage }}</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #d0d7de;\">Открытый бэк